{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38315","headline":"和集贤相公西溪侍宴观竞渡 · 吴融","name":"和集贤相公西溪侍宴观竞渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片水耸层桥，祥烟霭庆霄。\n昼花铺广宴，晴电闪飞桡。\n浪叠摇仙仗，风微定彩标。\n都人同盛观，不觉在行朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}